# ELVA ACC task set

From 2026-10-21, every full accuracy campaign (not smoke/limit) must evaluate:

1. **R4 four** (unchanged): `gqa`, `pope`, `mme`, `mmbench_en_dev`
2. **Extras** (report separately, do not fold into R4): `scienceqa_img`, `mmmu_val`, `ai2d`, `textvqa_val_ocr`, `vizwiz_vqa_val`

Use `elva_acc_tasks.ACC_TASKS` in launch scripts (9 tasks). Do not treat TextVQA without OCR (`textvqa_val`) as the default vqa-text arm unless the user explicitly asks. R4 formula and denominators stay frozen; extras are absolute scores only.
